  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童插珠帐篷拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "Kids Bead Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童拼搭与互动场景的插珠帐篷积木套装，采用杆件与连接球组合结构，可用于在室内外快速搭建城堡、帐篷和通道等造型，适合亲子互动与课堂活动。\n\n产品品牌为尧顺，材质为塑料/塑胶，适用年龄集中在4-6岁，支持反复拆装使用。",
    "en": "This is a kids fort-building set designed for creative construction and interaction. With rods and connector balls, children can quickly build castles, tents, and tunnel-like shapes for indoor or outdoor play, parent-child activities, and classroom use.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Material: plastic. The main age range is 4-6 years old, and the set supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童插珠帐篷拼搭积木套装采用“杆件+连接球”组合结构，可在较短时间内搭建出帐篷、房屋、城堡等多种空间造型，适合家庭客厅、儿童活动区和教学空间使用。",
      "产品强调动手拼装与空间构建过程，孩子在拆装和重构中可以进行创意表达与亲子协作。材质为塑料/塑胶，结构轻便，便于重复拼搭和收纳整理。",
      "该商品提供彩盒包装与本地素材图，适合零售、电商上架和活动课程配套采购。对于需要持续供货的渠道客户，也可按组合方案进行批量配置。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids bead-fort building set uses a rod-and-connector structure to create tents, houses, castles, and other spatial shapes in a short setup time. It fits living rooms, play areas, and classroom environments.",
      "The product focuses on hands-on construction and spatial play. Children can assemble, disassemble, and rebuild different structures for creative expression and parent-child interaction. The plastic material keeps it lightweight and suitable for repeated use.",
      "With color-box packaging and local image assets, this item is suitable for retail, e-commerce listing, and educational activity procurement. It can also be configured for batch supply based on channel needs."
    ]
  },
